+-- narrowest point: a red waistband under a dark walnut belt with a brass-hued
+-- buckle, and the apron's bow tied just off centre at the back. Below it the
+-- skirt steps out twice on the thighs, the apron widening with it, and a little
+-- walnut basket of apples hangs at the right hip.
